        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-140, Corcoran Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust imagine the elegance that installing this cabinet hardware will add to your home. The Corcoran Cabinet Door Knob has a 1-1/4 diameter and a 1-3/16 inch projection. It is available in 6 finishes. Pair dark cabinets with a satin nickel finish for a look that is very now; or go classic with light wood cabinets and this Corcoran Collection Cabinet Knob in a brushed english finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/corcoran-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Corcoran Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Corcoran Collection Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
